        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sincronizar el contenido de los artículos no leídos"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同步未读文章的内容"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Syncing article content increases iCloud storage use, sync time, and battery use.\n\nArticle status and the content of starred articles are always synced.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sincronizar el contenido de los artículos aumenta el uso del almacenamiento de iCloud, el tiempo de sincronización y el consumo de batería.\n\nEl estado de los artículos y el contenido de los artículos destacados siempre se sincronizan."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同步文章内容会增加 iCloud 存储用量、同步时间和电池消耗。\n\n文章状态和已收藏文章的内容始终会同步。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System Default (%@)": {
      "comment": "Default browser item title format",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Predeterminado del sistema (%@)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "系统默认（%@）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thanks to Sheila and my family; thanks to my friends in Seattle and around the globe; thanks to the ever-patient and ever-awesome NetNewsWire beta testers.\n\nThanks to [Gus Mueller](https://shapeof.com/) for [FMDB](https://github.com/ccgus/fmdb) by [Flying Meat Software](http://flyingmeat.com/). Thanks to [GitHub](https://github.com) and [Discourse](https://discourse.com) for making open source collaboration easy and fun. Thanks to [Ben Ubois](https://benubois.com/) at [Feedbin](https://feedbin.com) for all the extra help with syncing and article rendering — and [for hosting the server for the Reader view](https://feedbin.com/blog/2019/03/11/the-future-of-full-content/).": {
      "comment": "A list of credits for the app.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "感谢 Sheila 和我的家人；感谢我在西雅图和世界各地的朋友；感谢一直耐心又出色的 NetNewsWire Neo 测试人员。\n\n感谢 [Gus Mueller](https://shapeof.com/) 提供 [FMDB](https://github.com/ccgus/fmdb)（由 [Flying Meat Software](http://flyingmeat.com/) 开发）。感谢 [GitHub](https://github.com) 和 [Discourse](https://discourse.com) 让开源协作变得轻松有趣。感谢 [Feedbin](https://feedbin.com) 的 [Ben Ubois](https://benubois.com/) 在同步和文章渲染方面提供的所有额外帮助——以及[为阅读视图托管服务器](https://feedbin.com/blog/2019/03/11/the-future-of-full-content/)。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The name can be anything you want. You can even use emoji. 🎸": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El nombre puede ser el que quieras. Incluso puedes usar emojis. 🎸"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "名称可以是你想要的任何内容。你甚至可以使用表情符号。🎸"
          }
        }
      }
    },
